Suggested fixes
  1. Forms submit safely [forms-safe-transport, weight 7]
     Serve pages over HTTPS, post forms to the same origin over HTTPS, and never send passwords
     with method="get".
  2. Menus do not depend on hover [hover-only-menus, weight 3]
     Expose submenus through a <button aria-expanded> toggle, or render submenu links in the
     page (footer sitemap) so they are reachable without hover.
  3. No runtime errors during load [console-errors, weight 3]
     Fix uncaught exceptions and failed script requests reported during load.
  4. Control names are specific, not repeated or generic [ambiguous-control-names, weight 3]
     Make link and button text describe the destination or action ("Read the return policy",
     "Add Trail Bike to cart"). Avoid "Click here"/"Read more"; use aria-label to disambiguate
     when visual text must stay short.
  5. Headings form a usable outline [heading-structure, weight 3]
     One h1 per page naming the page; nest h2/h3 without skipping levels; no empty headings.

